direction_97 = location "Rotten Eyes" about "Rotten Eyes\nCorpse which has lost volition due to evil energy; undead monster exclusively harboring a hostility against all life forms" found "Karus" karus at 961 1466 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, here in the mainland there is a graveyard... How about meeting Bottom who is the keeper of the place?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Hello... I'm Bottom, and I manage the Graveyard. I don't know how many years have passed since I started to keep this graveyard. Ah- Could you help me, by the way?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I don't know since when, but  Rotten Eyes have begun to appear at the graveyard and I cannot drive them out by myself. They're zombie monsters like Undyings, and the problem is that they come and make a terrible mess in the place. Could you try and protect the graveyard from them?\n\nYou'll get some Armor out of this if you do the [Nameless Warrior] this favor."

On in_progress
    Say "The graveyard must be protected no matter what happens. Please, do your best."

On ready
    Say "Well done master, well done."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Meeting you is possibly the best bit of luck I've ever had! Thank you, thank you so much. Here's a little something for ya. This is what I found while I've been keeping this place, and should be quite useful."
